{"id":"ce76a1073595f5b0","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-primitive-recursive-class.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Class","display":"df-primitive-recursive-class — Primitive Recursive Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-primitive-recursive-class","aliases":["88-df-primitive-recursive-class"],"display":"df-primitive-recursive-class — Primitive Recursive Class","depends_on":["[[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]","[[88-df-zero-function]]","[[88-df-successor-function]]","[[88-df-projection-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-primitive-recursive-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-primitive-recursive-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-recursive-class — Primitive Recursive Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73df252510501ed2\" href=\"?note=73df252510501ed2\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme\">88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69f9994fe732757d\" href=\"?note=69f9994fe732757d\" title=\"88-df-zero-function\">88-df-zero-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0f63c32733077b50\" href=\"?note=0f63c32733077b50\" title=\"88-df-successor-function\">88-df-successor-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"78a1a0c916e243a2\" href=\"?note=78a1a0c916e243a2\" title=\"88-df-projection-function\">88-df-projection-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> (all finite-arity total number-theoretic functions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PR}\">\\(\\mathcal{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (backward-compatible class notation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_k,S_{\\mathbb N},P_i^n\">\\(Z_k,S_{\\mathbb N},P_i^n\\)</span> (initial functions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}(f;g,h)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}(f;g,h)\\)</span> (primitive-recursion scheme, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"73df252510501ed2\" href=\"?note=73df252510501ed2\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme\">88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme</a>)</li>\n<li>本文件的数值函数接口采用一元图搬运：沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto\\langle x\\rangle\">\\(x\\mapsto\\langle x\\rangle\\)</span>，输入为自然数的图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\">\\(f\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\\)</span> 在一元组输入位置表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\}\\)</span>；在函数类型、复合及类成员式中先统一到元组输入表示。特别地，闭包初函数位置的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(S_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,x+1\\rangle:x\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,x+1\\rangle:x\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。这不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^1\">\\(\\mathbb N^1\\)</span> 断言为字面相等，也不删除编码中的元组层。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{tot}}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{tot}}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{PR}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{tot}}:\n&amp;\\{S_{\\mathbb N}\\}\\cup\\{Z_k:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\cup\\{P_i^n:n\\geq1\\land1\\leq i\\leq n\\}\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m\\geq1\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\mathcal C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\;\n\\forall h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\in\\mathcal C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\;\\Bigl(\ng\\circ\\langle h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f,g,h\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\\land g,h\\in\\mathcal C\n\\to f\\in\\mathcal C\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{PR}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{tot}}:\n&amp;\\{S_{\\mathbb N}\\}\\cup\\{Z_k:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\cup\\{P_i^n:n\\geq1\\land1\\leq i\\leq n\\}\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m\\geq1\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\mathcal C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\;\n\\forall h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\in\\mathcal C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\;\\Bigl(\ng\\circ\\langle h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f,g,h\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\\land g,h\\in\\mathcal C\n\\to f\\in\\mathcal C\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\\mathcal{PR}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\\mathcal{PR}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PR}\">\\(\\mathcal{PR}\\)</span>从全部元数的零函数、数值后继和全部投影生成</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span>保留为同一函数类的旧排版别名，供既有下游原子解析。</li>\n<li>通过复合和原始递归封闭</li>\n<li>复合分句显式要求所有内函数具有同一输入元数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>，外函数元数为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>严格包含关系和 Ackermann 反例是定理，不是本闭包定义本身。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme","status":"resolved","id":"73df252510501ed2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"69f9994fe732757d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-zero-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"0f63c32733077b50","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-successor-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"78a1a0c916e243a2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-projection-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme","status":"resolved","id":"73df252510501ed2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}(f;g,h)$ (primitive-recursion scheme, see [[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"Z_k,S_{\\mathbb N},P_i^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}(f;g,h)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\mapsto\\langle x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"f\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,y\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,x+1\\rangle:x\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{tot}}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{PR}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{tot}}:\n&\\{S_{\\mathbb N}\\}\\cup\\{Z_k:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\cup\\{P_i^n:n\\geq1\\land1\\leq i\\leq n\\}\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall m\\geq1\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\mathcal C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\;\n\\forall h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\in\\mathcal C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\;\\Bigl(\ng\\circ\\langle h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C\\Bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f,g,h\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\\land g,h\\in\\mathcal C\n\\to f\\in\\mathcal C\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\\mathcal{PR}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false}],"bytes":2667,"backlinks":[{"id":"92178dc88a5e0bd4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{PR}$ (primitive-recursive class, see [[88-df-primitive-recursive-class]])"},{"id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{PR}$ (primitive-recursive class, see [[88-df-primitive-recursive-class]])"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-classical-calculus.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[88-df-consistent.md]]\n[[88-df-countable.md]]\n[[88-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[88-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[88-df-defined.md]]\n[[88-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-delta1-set.md]]\n[[88-df-derivation.md]]\n[[88-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-join.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-elementary-equivalence.md]]\n[[88-df-elementary-substructure.md]]\n[[88-df-encoding.md]]\n[[88-df-finite-extension.md]]\n[[88-df-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-df-formula.md]]\n[[88-df